    "statement": "\n    {Ω : Type*} [MeasurableSpace Ω] (μ : Measure Ω)\n    (D : Lp ℝ 2 μ →L[ℝ] Lp ℝ 2 μ) (hD : D.IsPositive) :\n    ∃ Γ : Lp ℝ 2 μ →L[ℝ] Lp ℝ 2 μ,\n      Γ.IsPositive ∧ Γ*Γ = D ∧\n      ∀ u : Lp ℝ 2 μ, ‖Γ u‖^2 = inner ℝ (D u) u",
    "statement_sha256": "5bccad7164a2875854a566c839c3d5765b251215c22a6cf968e1b4faf7f06b00",
    "compiled": true,
    "approved_definition_context": [
      "Lp exponent 2 denotes AE equivalence classes of square-integrable measurable functions over the displayed arbitrary measure, with their integral real Hilbert structure. No finite or probability measure is assumed.",
      "Continuous real-linear bounded endomorphism multiplication is composition. D.IsPositive means selfadjointness and a nonnegative quadratic form. The positive REAL root, its square and full-domain energy are conclusions; no CFC/root/complex-extension hypothesis is present."
